-- 7. The Bowery Hotel
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'The Bowery Hotel',
'East Village',
'Hotel Lobby',
'The Bowery Hotel is what happens when someone decides to make a hotel look like it has always been there, and succeeds so completely that it becomes the realest-feeling place in the neighborhood. The lobby is all worn leather and exposed brick. The terrace bar has drawn the right kind of downtown crowd for fifteen years. Johnny Depp has stayed here. So has Patti Smith. So did the person sitting next to you, probably.',
40.7248000, -73.9915000,
NULL,
3,
'{"men": {"brands": ["Nudie Jeans", "Acne Studios", "Our Legacy", "R.M. Williams"], "outfit": {"top": "Lived-in leather jacket or a heavy cotton overshirt in olive or charcoal", "bottom": "Dark slim jeans or carpenter pants, intentionally worn", "shoes": "Chelsea boots or a clean sneaker with heritage credentials", "bag": "Canvas tote or nothing", "accessories": "A mechanical watch that looks like it was bought at a flea market (but wasn''t), simple ring"}, "color_palette": "Black, charcoal, olive, worn denim — the palette of someone who has been coming to this neighborhood since before it changed", "budget_dupe": "Levi''s, a vintage leather jacket from eBay, Chelsea boots from Thursday Boot Co. The Bowery rewards authenticity over expense."}, "women": {"brands": ["Isabel Marant", "Toteme", "Ganni", "Golden Goose"], "outfit": {"top": "Loose oversized blazer or vintage-style band tee under a structured leather jacket", "bottom": "Straight-leg jeans with a slight let-down hem, or a midi skirt in dark floral", "shoes": "Platform boots or broken-in Golden Goose sneakers (if you must)", "bag": "Leather crossbody or a soft hobo bag", "accessories": "Stacked silver rings, small hoop earrings, possibly a scarf"}, "color_palette": "Dark denim, black, rust, off-white — the palette of someone who has read all the right books about this neighborhood", "budget_dupe": "Vintage finds are the entire point here. A great vintage blazer, well-worn jeans, good boots. Downtown cool is about having a history, even if it''s borrowed."}}',
