-- 8. The Greenwich Hotel
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'The Greenwich Hotel',
'Tribeca',
'Hotel Lobby',
'Robert De Niro''s hotel in Tribeca is one of the most genuinely comfortable boutique hotels in New York — no two rooms are alike, every surface has a provenance, and the Japanese-style pool is a legitimate secret. The lobby has the quality of a very good friend''s very grand house. Locanda Verde on the ground floor is a power breakfast destination for the film and finance overlap that defines this neighborhood.',
