-- 9. Nine Orchard
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'Nine Orchard',
'Lower East Side',
'Hotel Lobby',
'A converted 1920s Lower East Side bank building that has become the most interesting hotel in downtown Manhattan. The interiors are all original stone, brass, and marble — nothing was added that wasn''t already there or didn''t belong. The ground-floor restaurant and bar have a serious art world following. The LES crowd mixes with the uptown transplants who read about it in a magazine and haven''t left.',
