-- 10. Top of The Standard / Boom Boom Room
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'Top of The Standard',
'Meatpacking District',
'Rooftop Bar',
'The 18th floor of The Standard High Line, perched over the Hudson on stilts above the old meatpacking district. The views cover the river, Jersey City, and the entire western edge of Manhattan. The Le Bain club and the Boom Boom Room below it are the closest thing New York has to a proper nightlife institution — which means the door policy is real, the crowd is deliberate, and the drinks are worth the price if only because the view makes everything taste better.',
40.7396000, -74.0075000,
NULL,
4,
'{"men": {"brands": ["Saint Laurent", "Acne Studios", "Audemars Piguet", "Corthay"], "outfit": {"top": "Black slim blazer or a dark Saint Laurent shirt — the door policy here responds to intentional dressing", "bottom": "Dark slim jeans or black tailored trousers", "shoes": "Clean black Chelsea boots or a dark leather Oxford", "bag": "Nothing", "accessories": "A watch that doesn''t shout — AP Royal Oak reads correctly here; a Submariner also works"}, "color_palette": "Black, deep navy, dark grey — this is an evening location and the sunset over the Hudson is the only color you need", "budget_dupe": "A well-fitted black blazer from H&M or ASOS, dark jeans, clean black boots. The key word for this door is intentional. Look like you chose every piece."}, "women": {"brands": ["Saint Laurent", "Jacquemus", "Versace", "Louboutin"], "outfit": {"top": "A slip dress in black or deep navy, or a structured crop top and tailored trousers", "bottom": "High-waisted cigarette trousers or a short fluid skirt", "shoes": "Strappy heeled sandal or pointed-toe heel — the roof terrace is a concrete deck, heels are manageable", "bag": "A small crossbody or clutch — you''ll be standing most of the time", "accessories": "Statement earrings, a thin gold or silver body chain, keep the neck clean"}, "color_palette": "Black, deep cobalt, sheer — this crowd dresses for the city, not the neighborhood", "budget_dupe": "A great vintage slip dress and quality heels. The view from the roof does enormous work on behalf of every outfit up here."}}',
true),

-- 11. Summit One Vanderbilt
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'Summit One Vanderbilt',
'Midtown',
'Art World',
'The observation experience on the upper floors of One Vanderbilt is an art installation before it is a view. Kenzo Digital''s Summit experience is all mirrors and mist and glass elevators extending over 42nd Street. The views are, by any objective measure, the best in Manhattan — but the thing that sets it apart is the deliberate blurring of the line between standing inside a skyscraper and standing in the clouds.',
40.7527000, -73.9777000,
NULL,
2,
'{"men": {"brands": ["Any well-assembled outfit", "Good sneakers are appropriate", "Casual fine"], "outfit": {"top": "Relaxed but considered — a good crewneck or a structured shirt in a clean colour", "bottom": "Dark jeans or straight-leg chinos", "shoes": "Clean white or neutral sneakers — you''ll be walking on glass floors", "bag": "Small backpack or crossbody — you need your hands free for photos", "accessories": "Minimal — the mirrored rooms will multiply everything you wear"}, "color_palette": "Solids only — patterns fragment strangely in the mirror rooms. Navy, black, white, grey.", "budget_dupe": "This is a tourist experience with a luxury price point. A clean, solid-colour outfit from anywhere is appropriate. The installation is the show."}, "women": {"brands": ["Any", "The mirrors will make you look great regardless"], "outfit": {"top": "A solid-colour top or dress — the reflection rooms are built for photos and patterns distort", "bottom": "High-waisted trousers or a fitted midi skirt in a single colour", "shoes": "Comfortable but clean — there is a lot of walking and some glass floors", "bag": "Small — crossbody or clutch, you want both hands", "accessories": "Minimal jewellery that won''t cause an infinity problem in the mirrors"}, "color_palette": "Monochromatic — pick one colour and commit. The mirror rooms will do the rest.", "budget_dupe": "A great outfit from anywhere looks exceptional in the Summit mirrors. The architecture is democratically photogenic."}}',
