-- 13. The Oculus
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'The Oculus',
'Financial District',
'Continental',
'Santiago Calatrava''s $3.9 billion transit hub is the most polarising piece of architecture in New York, which is saying something. Whether you think it looks like a bird or a stegosaurus, you cannot deny that the interior — a great white rib-vaulted hall of marble and glass — is one of the most extraordinary public spaces in the city. Walk through it at 9am when the morning light falls through the spine and you will briefly understand why architecture matters.',
40.7117000, -74.0130000,
NULL,
1,
'{"men": {"brands": ["Whatever you''re wearing downtown", "This is a transit hub"], "outfit": {"top": "A clean, considered outfit — the Oculus rewards people who look like they belong in a white marble hall", "bottom": "Dark trousers or jeans", "shoes": "Clean shoes — the floors are white marble and reflective", "bag": "A work bag or structured tote — you look like you''re on your way somewhere important", "accessories": "A watch, nothing else necessary"}, "color_palette": "The Oculus is white and light — dark colours create a striking contrast, all-cream reads as architectural", "budget_dupe": "This is public infrastructure. The architecture is free. Wear whatever makes you feel like you belong in a white marble cathedral."}, "women": {"brands": ["Whatever reads as intentional"], "outfit": {"top": "Something structured — the soaring white space rewards a jacket or coat", "bottom": "Tailored trousers or a clean midi skirt", "shoes": "Clean leather shoes — the white marble floor is unforgiving on scuffed heels", "bag": "A structured bag worn seriously, as if you have somewhere to be", "accessories": "Minimal — the space is the statement"}, "color_palette": "All-black is the natural foil to the white interior. All-cream disappears into the building in the best possible way.", "budget_dupe": "Any clean, well-assembled outfit. The Oculus is the most democratic luxury space in New York — the architecture is free and the light is extraordinary."}}',
