-- 14. Grand Central Terminal
('11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001',
'Grand Central Terminal',
'Midtown',
'Continental',
'The greatest room in New York, by area and by argument. The main concourse — with its turquoise-and-gold celestial ceiling, its marble floors, its forty-foot windows — was almost demolished in the 1960s and saved by a preservation movement that Jackie Kennedy helped lead. The Oyster Bar downstairs is a New York institution. The Campbell Bar upstairs is a hidden room in a 1920s financier''s private office. Walk through the main hall when a shaft of light comes through those south windows and remember that cities still occasionally build extraordinary things.',
40.7527000, -73.9771000,
NULL,
2,
'{"men": {"brands": ["Appropriately serious"], "outfit": {"top": "A blazer or good coat — Grand Central rewards looking like you arrived on a train from somewhere worth coming from", "bottom": "Tailored trousers or dark jeans", "shoes": "Leather shoes — the marble floor is the stage", "bag": "A proper bag with some weight to it — briefcase, structured tote", "accessories": "A watch. This is a place that takes time seriously."}, "color_palette": "Navy, charcoal, camel — the palette of American institutional authority at its best", "budget_dupe": "A clean blazer from anywhere, leather-soled shoes. Grand Central is public infrastructure that happens to be sublime. Dress like you appreciate that."}, "women": {"brands": ["Composed and purposeful"], "outfit": {"top": "A structured coat or blazer — the scale of the main concourse makes casual dress look small", "bottom": "Tailored trousers or a midi skirt with movement", "shoes": "Heels or pointed-toe flats in leather — you are walking on 1913 marble", "bag": "A serious bag — structured leather tote or a proper handbag", "accessories": "Simple gold or silver, nothing that makes noise. The building has its own acoustics."}, "color_palette": "Dark emerald, deep navy, cream and gold — the building''s palette is celestial and yours should respond to it", "budget_dupe": "A great coat from anywhere. Grand Central is the most beautiful commuter terminal ever built and everyone who passes through it is briefly part of something magnificent."}}',
true),

